{
  "$comment": "AlgoMinutes design tokens — the single source for web (Tailwind @theme), SwiftUI Theme.swift, and the Compose theme (A6.5). PROVISIONAL: TODO(brand) — the final accent hue, logo, and typeface need brand sign-off; the values below are a coherent, accessible v1 (WCAG AA body text) so the product renders as AlgoMinutes, not the prior client theme. Dark is the app's primary surface; a light ramp is defined for accessibility/system-preference support (web/iOS apply dark first; full light-mode wiring is a follow-up).",
